  "content": "<p>A simple <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> mod to make the loading screen darker.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/333/641/description.png\" alt=\"In-game appearance\"></p>\n<p>A changelog is available <a href=\"https://github.com/A5b84/dark-loading-screen/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a>.</p>\n<h2>Color configuration</h2>\n<p>Colors can be modified in-game if both <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> and <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a> are installed.</p>\n<h3>Manual configuration</h3>\n<p>Create or edit <code>.minecraft/config/dark-loading-screen.json</code>, the default config is</p>\n<pre><code>{\n    \"background\": \"14181c\",\n    \"bar\": \"e22837\",\n    \"barBackground\": \"14181c\",\n    \"border\": \"303336\",\n    \"logo\": \"ffffff\",\n    \"fadeIn\": 1.0,\n    \"fadeOut\": 2.0\n}</code></pre>\n<p>Manual changes are only visible after restarting the game.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Config screen made using <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shedaniel/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">shedaniel</a>'s Cloth Config</li>\n<li>Logo coloring suggested by <a href=\"https://github.com/Minenash\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minenash</a></li>\n<li>Bar background coloring suggested by <a href=\"https://github.com/Chrisblox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chrisblox</a></li>\n<li><code>bg_bg</code> translation by <a href=\"https://github.com/natee22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">natee22</a></li>\n<li><code>de_de</code> translation by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/der_anderl/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Der_Anderl</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/moritz-htk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">moritz-htk</a></li>\n<li><code>es_xx</code> translations by <a href=\"https://github.com/Haseck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Haseck</a></li>\n<li><code>it_it</code> translations by <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/awesome_nobel58/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ocizuko</a></li>\n<li><code>ko_kr</code> translation by <a href=\"https://github.com/gyular\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">gyular</a></li>\n<li><code>pl_pl</code> translation by <a href=\"https://github.com/DarkKnightComes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkKnightComes</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/goodideagiver\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">goodideagiver</a></li>\n<li><code>pt_br</code> translation by <a href=\"https://github.com/FITFC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FITFC</a></li>\n<li><code>ru_ru</code> translation by <a href=\"https://github.com/Felix14-v2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Felix14-v2</a></li>\n<li><code>sv_se</code> translation by <a href=\"https://github.com/Luracasmus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Luracasmus</a></li>\n<li><code>tr_tr</code> translation by <a href=\"https://github.com/Mid0aria\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mid0aria</a></li>\n<li><code>uk_ua</code> translation by <a href=\"https://github.com/BurrConnie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BurrConnie</a></li>\n<li><code>zh_cn</code> translation by <a href=\"https://github.com/GodGun968\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GodGun968</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/Hambaka\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hambaka</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/w5860363\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">w5860363</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/Q2297045667\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Q2297045667</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Links: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dark-loading-screen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/A5b84/dark-loading-screen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdark-loading-screen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></p>",
